 removes voters by disconnecting their transports rather than stopping their processes, so the removed nodes keep running and campaigning; that does not affect the quorum arithmetic but is a difference from a real failure.\\\",\n   \\\"Each step was observed for 1500 ms with 25 ms sampling; a slower commit or a later snapshot-driven repair beyond the window is not claimed.\\\",\n   \\\"One retained execution per case, in-memory transport, deterministic fault injection on a single node, default protocol version.\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"report_title\\\":\\\"被卡死副本确切地消耗一份故障余量：五节点集群仅能再容错一台，对照组可容错两台\\\",\n  \\\"report_answer\\\":\\\"针对第二条发现的余量推广，本次保留执行 \\\"+R+\\\" 在同一套合法历史（分区、分歧、更高任期替换）上把规模参数化后得到确证：五节点对照组中，移除 1 台投票者后新条目仍提交（commit 5→6），再移除 1 台（共 2 台）后仍提交（6→7）；五节点故障组中，移除 1 台时仍能提交（5→6），再移除 1 台（共 2 台）时领导者自身日志已到 index 7（store 1..7、证书 (7,3)），但 1500 毫秒窗口内 commit 恒为 6、客户端 future 永不完成。三节点基线同样如此：对照组移除 1 台可提交，故障组移除 1 台即停摆。被卡死副本的探针在各步骤中完全不变（store last 2、证书 (4,2)、GetLog 报 log not found、StoreLogs 尝试次数停 3）。结论：卡死副本的承诺槽位被冻结在旧下标，因此确切消耗一份故障余量——三节点集群失去单点容错，五节点集群从『可容错两台』降为『仅能容错一台』；该余量损失持续到该副本被重启（同盘重启已证实可修复）或被替换为止。缺陷主张维持，余量结论以两种规模与提交法定人数算术为依据。\\\"\n }],\n \\\"knowledge\\\":[{\n  \\\"id\\\":\\\"3c9253570cfc4de4aef0549f41a050d1-knowledge-0\\\",\n  \\\"kind\\\":\\\"behavior\\\",\n  \\\"statement\\\":\\\"commitment keeps one match index per voter of the current configuration and takes the quorum match index as the middle of the sorted values, so a voter whose stored log can never advance holds its slot at the stuck index for as long as the configuration stands. The wedged replica therefore consumes exactly one unit of the configuration's failure margin: the remaining voters must be able to form a quorum on their own, which in a three-voter configuration is impossible once one other voter is gone and in a five-voter configuration only becomes impossible when two other voters are gone.\\\",\n  \\\"conditions\\\":\\\"Leader state; a voter whose durable log is stuck below the leader's committed prefix while it remains a member of configurations.latest; commitment.setConfiguration has been applied for that configuration.\\\",\n  \\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"commitment-recalculate-quorum\\\",\\\"commitment-set-configuration\\\",\\\"appendentries-entry-loop-cached-lastlog\\\",\\\"replication-nextindex-floor\\\"],\n  \\\"executions\\\":{R:[15,16,20,21,3,7]}\n }]\n}\nopen('update.json','w').write(json.dumps(upd,indent=2)+\\\"\\\\n\\\")\nprint('ok', json.load(open('update.json'))['interpretations'][0]['conclusion'], list(json.load(open('update.json'))['interpretations'][0]['executions'].keys()))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"ok violated ['f82d709e8f5f4f80ba19cc48ff29ff0a']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
